  "//playwright": "@playwright/test is pinned exactly. Browsers come from devenv (pkgs.playwright-driver.browsers), which ships chromium_headless_shell-1217 — the build Playwright 1.59.x expects. A caret range lets npm install 1.62, which looks for -1234 and fails to launch every test. Bump this only together with devenv's nixpkgs.",
